title Vinyl: design QA walk at 640x480, the approved NP-640x480 layout (owner, 2026-11-13: "that works"): cover 224 with the record, the flat format and Gapless chips, the output button, five transport keys, Browse, Queue and the volume group in the bottom row, no Up next, no Menu key (P2)
sizes 640x480
# the deck's own density (11.3 px/mm) leaves the approved 640x480 layout's touch rows 70 px, under the 7 mm (79 px):
# owner rule R-4, listed in qa-info.txt; the scene runs at a 3.5-inch 640x480 panel's 9.01 px/mm (the harness's own
# 480x640), whose 7 mm (63 px) the rows hold, the toolkit header as on the deck (56 px)
ppmm 901
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing

wait 1200
shot 01-now
expect esc
expect text "Vinyl"
expect text "60"
expect text "Evolve 65"
expect text "Browse"
expect text "Queue"
expect notext "Vol 60"
expect notext "UP NEXT"
expect notext "Menu"
wait 300
shot 02-now-volume
# the group's "+" (an icon: no text to tap); one level up: 60 % (level 18 of 30) to 63 %
tapxy 0.904 0.912
wait 300
shot 03-now-volume-up
expect text "63"
# the output button opens the Output page
tap "Evolve 65"
wait 400
expect text "Automatic"
key left
wait 300
key b
wait 400
shot 05-browser
expect text "MUSIC / PHOENIX"
key q
wait 400
shot 06-queue
expect text "Move down"
key left
wait 300
key o
wait 400
shot 07-output
expect text "Automatic"
key left
wait 300
expect text "MUSIC / PHOENIX"
key esc
expect quit
